{"speciesId":252,"names":{"fr":"Arcko","es":"Treecko","en":"Treecko","ja":"キモリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"TREECKO has small hooks on the bottom of its feet that enable it to scale vertical walls. This POKéMON attacks by slamming foes with its thick tail."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"TREECKO is cool, calm, and collected - it never panics under any situation. If a bigger foe were to glare at this POKéMON, it would glare right back without conceding an inch of ground."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It makes its nest in a giant tree in the forest. It ferociously guards against anything nearing its territory. It is said to be the protector of the forest’s trees."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It quickly scales even vertical walls. It senses humidity with its tail to predict the next day’s weather."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It quickly scales even vertical walls. It senses humidity with its tail to predict the next day’s weather."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses plantes de pieds sont couvertes d’épines lui permettant de marcher au mur et au plafond."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses plantes de pieds sont couvertes d’épines lui permettant de marcher au mur et au plafond."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Arcko peut grimper aux murs à l’aide de ses pattes. Grâce à sa queue, il est capable de mesurer l’humidité de l’air et de prédire le temps du jour suivant."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Escala superficies verticales muy rápido. Con la cola detecta la humedad y prevé el tiempo que va a hacer."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It quickly scales even vertical walls. It senses humidity with its tail to predict the next day’s weather."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"垂直の 壁も すいすい 登る。 尻尾で 空気の 湿度を 感じ 明日の 天気を 当てる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les épines de ses plantes de pieds lui permettent de marcher aux murs et au plafond sans tomber."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene pequeñas púas en las plantas de los pies que le permiten andar por techos y paredes sin caerse."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"足の 裏の 小さな トゲが 壁や 天井に 引っかかるので 逆さまに なっても 落ちないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Arcko est doté de petits crochets sous les pattes, ce qui lui permet de grimper aux murs. Ce Pokémon attaque en frappant ses ennemis avec son épaisse queue."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Treecko tiene unos ganchos pequeños en las plantas de los pies con los que puede escalar superficies verticales. Este Pokémon ataca dando un golpetazo con la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Treecko has small hooks on the bottom of its feet that enable it to scale vertical walls. This Pokémon attacks by slamming foes with its thick tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"足の 裏の 小さな トゲを 引っ掛けて 垂直の カベを 登ることが できる。 太い 尻尾を たたきつけて 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arcko est cool, calme et serein. Il ne panique jamais, quelle que soit la situation. Quand un ennemi plus gros que lui lui lance un regard de défi, ce Pokémon reste stoïque et ne cède pas un centimètre de terrain."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Treecko es tranquilo y tiene gran capacidad de autocontrol; no pierde la calma en ninguna situación. Si algún rival se le queda mirando fijamente, le devolverá la mirada sin ceder ni lo más mínimo de su territorio."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Treecko is cool, calm, and collected—it never panics under any situation. If a bigger foe were to glare at this Pokémon, it would glare right back without conceding an inch of ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"沈着 冷静 何事にも 動じない。 体の 大きな ポケモンに にらまれても 一歩も 引かずに にらみかえすぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":252,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"razor-wind","lear